    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash of Melodies</strong> is a Visual Novel Rhythm Game, set in a high fantasy world. It's telling the story of two dorks who don't like each other going on an adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>two rhythm game modes</strong>: One <strong>DDR / FNF inspired</strong>\u00a0&quot;<strong>Arrow&quot; Mode</strong>, and an <strong>original &quot;Circle&quot; Mode,</strong> in which you have to catch the incoming note with a circle in the middle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the story is told through classic visual novel style text cutscenes, as well as a few fully animated sequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have beaten a stage in the story, you can go for a highscore and a full combo in <strong>Freeplay.</strong> There you can also choose a <strong>hard mode</strong> that keeps a separate score.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash of Melodies</strong> is a Visual Novel Rhythm Game, set in a high fantasy world. It's telling the story of two dorks who don't like each other going on an adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>two rhythm game modes</strong>: One <strong>DDR / FNF inspired</strong>\u00a0&quot;<strong>Arrow&quot; Mode</strong>, and an <strong>original &quot;Circle&quot; Mode,</strong> in which you have to catch the incoming note with a circle in the middle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the story is told through classic visual novel style text cutscenes, as well as a few fully animated sequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have beaten a stage in the story, you can go for a highscore and a full combo in <strong>Freeplay.</strong> There you can also choose a <strong>hard mode</strong> that keeps a separate score.\u00a0</p>",
